  "source_supported_conclusion": "Outgoing gRPC metadata credit ownership escapes into the persistent HPACK dynamic table. The existing request admission permit remains held after its physical managed ABI owner retires. Closing only the first HTTP2 connection releases response metadata grants, permits native request reaping, and admits the queued independent second client. This predates the scratch candidate.",
